,"html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119946#issuecomment-4603060314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119946","id":4603060314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEl0gWg","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T13:51:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T14:32:13Z","body":"> [@BrotherShort](https://github.com/BrotherShort) Yes, but that is something I do not want. I'm saying that the character replacement should be moved out of that condition.\n\nWhy do you not want it?\nIf the character replacement are moved out of that condition, Expressions like `pow(3,3)` will be converted to `pow(3.3)` first. Then parsing failed. Then parse `pow(3,3)`. Finally get 27.\nI think this could create potential issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4603060314/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053931028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119946#issuecomment-5053931028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119946","id":5053931028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLTzeFA","user":{"login":"blockninja124","id":64211894,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjExODk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64211894?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124","html_url":"https://github.com/blockninja124","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T03:19:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T03:19:59Z","body":"Related to this issue, I would also love for the spinbox to have automatic comma rendering. By that I mean if the user types:\n1000000\nit will render as:\n1,000,000\nbut the internal value is still 1000000\n\nThis feature could be a setting turned on in the spinbox inspector.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053931028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]